{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile settings and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727. These results suggest multiprofile may improve RNA-only performance compared to singleprofile (0.4849), but uncertainty remains regarding the impact of other factors like RNA encoders or fusion strategies. The experiment isolates profile settings, but further comparisons with alternative encoders or fusion methods are needed to confirm these findings."
}

